===== Installation =====

There is (as of 2023/05) a unresolved problem with builds for Ubnt units with **ONE** ethernet port. Flashing a OpenWRT ath79 version after 19.07.10 will brick the unit. The last working version is 19.07.10 AR71xx. As mentioned in [[toh:ubiquiti:airmaxm|Ubiquiti Airmax M]] install the latest working buld and check your CPU with: 
 
 cat /proc/cpuinfo

if its AR7240 or Ar7241 and then flash the corresponding Ubiquiti **BULLET** M image! This is a one eth port only unit and is tested to be working on locos XM and rocket M.

